cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark codebase, experimental results, or evaluation methodology, please cite it as below."
title: "Rigorous Matched-Distortion Evaluation and Empirical Benchmark for Frequency-Domain Adaptive Image Watermarking"
abstract: "A comprehensive, reproducible benchmark suite for robust frequency-domain digital image watermarking. Evaluates adaptive vs. fixed DWT-DCT-SVD embedding under strict matched clean cover distortion (46.0 dB PSNR) across 208 standardized images and 100 COCO images, rigorous hypothesis testing (H1-H4), 880,000+ trial executions, geometric synchronization deskewing, Craver ambiguity vulnerability analysis, and generative diffusion post-processing threat models."
